// The WebSocket frame layer, RFC 6455 §5:
// https://www.rfc-editor.org/rfc/rfc6455#section-5
//
// Opcodes, the frame codec with its masking, the reassembly of a fragmented message
// (§5.4) around the control frames interleaved with it (§5.5), and the close statuses
// §7.4.1 allows on the wire.
//
// The opening handshake is `upgrade`, which is where the dependencies are: proving a
// key needs SHA-1 and base64, and framing needs nothing at all.
import {
  "moonbitlang/core/encoding/utf8",
}
